{{Documentation/Header}}
This template is used by {{t|LatestUserBlogs}} to format individual blog post items.

== Parameters ==
* '''page''' - The full page name (e.g., "User blog:Username/Post Title")
* '''title''' - The post title without namespace
* '''user''' - The last editor/author
* '''date''' - The last edit date

== Usage ==
This template formats individual blog entries for display in the latest user blogs list. It creates a standardized layout showing the blog post title, author, and publication date.

== Syntax ==
{{T|{{BASEPAGENAMEE}}|v1=page=|v2=title=|v3=user=|v4=date=}}

== Parameters (detailed) ==
{| class="wikitable"
|-
! Parameter !! Required !! Description !! Example
|-
| page || Yes || Full page name including namespace || <code>User blog:JohnDoe/My Adventure</code>
|-
| title || Yes || Post title without the namespace prefix || <code>My Adventure</code>
|-
| user || Yes || Username of the blog author/last editor || <code>JohnDoe</code>
|-
| date || Yes || Last edit date in wiki format || <code>2024-01-15</code>
|-
| pinned || No || Any value except <code>no</code> marks the post as pinned: adds a thumbtack icon and the <code>blog-card-pinned</code> class || <code>yes</code>
|}

== Examples ==
=== Basic usage ===
{{T|{{BASEPAGENAME}}|page=User blog:Example/Sample Post|title=Sample Post|user=Example|date=2024-01-15|block=1}}

=== Multiple entries ===
{{T|{{BASEPAGENAME}}|page=User blog:Alice/Travel Adventures|title=Travel Adventures|user=Alice|date=2024-01-10|block=1}}
{{T|{{BASEPAGENAME}}|page=User blog:Bob/Game Review|title=Game Review|user=Bob|date=2024-01-08|block=1}}

== Output ==
The template generates a formatted list item with:
* Linked blog post title
* Author attribution
* Publication date
* Consistent styling for the blog list

== See also ==
* {{t|LatestUserBlogs}} - Main template that uses this formatter
* [[Help:User blogs]] - General help for user blogs
* [[Special:RecentChanges]] - Recent wiki activity

